E0213  1:20-1:29
  `weak[int]` is invalid: weak references only apply to reference types
  help: structs, enums, List, Map and functions can be weakly referenced; primitives and strings cannot

E0213  1:37-1:38
  cannot create a weak reference to `int`
  help: weak references apply to structs, enums, List, Map, and functions (PRD §4.2)

